  message: "STAGE 1 OF THE ARC-FINISHING ORDER (WI-nazos, 2026-09-06) CLOSED: both second/third-pass sub-items are done on their filed rows.\n  WI-lunav DONE -- all eight builder rows stay (adjudicated 08-28, re-checked at dev f235da6704; XMLHttpRequest.open newly reachable since #753 and kept by signature class). Residual filed as WI-difup-godit-jupon-vafos-lapim-tupil-vakud-dumul, Phase 6.\n  WI-zumoz DONE -- the three property rows are unmatchable because assignment is not a call, demonstrable now that #753 resolves the receiver; shipped as a dated declared blindness, analyzer_disclosure.CONSTRUCT_BLIND_ROWS + caveat `analyzer_construct_blind` (PR #788). Residual (a registration edge) filed as WI-dosuh-zizur-jutun-lobir-pahug-rokom-puzat-sanof, Phase 6.\nThis item is unblocked in `ready` once those two resolve. WHAT IT STILL HOLDS, unchanged from 09-04: the unswept ~2900 rows against the root cause; WI-baran (c socket family, unblocked in fact since #743, still no isbefore); elixir Application.get_env env_read unadjudicated; c.yaml:154 stale ipc_send note.\nLESSON, carried to LIVE: a sub-item can sit \"blocked\" on a fix that shipped days ago without the block being lifted -- WI-zumoz read blocked on INV-misup, which was satisfied 09-04. Re-check a blocker's STATUS, not the item's prose."  # e881
